Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:59.27,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（过去）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.25,0:00:57.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.17,0:17:34.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（严禁烟火 阿内特气罐公司）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.50,0:27:25.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不再信任…）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.57,0:41:27.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（无处避难）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.02,0:41:30.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（过去）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.97,0:00:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该树立标牌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should never have put up the signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.97,0:00:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以为会发生什么事啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell did we think was gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们把他们引来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We brought them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.59,0:00:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在努力做好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were trying to do something good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.37,0:00:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们试图保持人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were being human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在是什么 葛瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we now, Gareth?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.98,0:01:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不像坏人 但我准备走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They seemed nice enough, but I was ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.46,0:01:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我们刚到这里 但是该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got here, but, damn,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.39,0:01:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他们说起华盛顿时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I told them about DC,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.61,0:01:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的老大使了个眼色\N{\fnArial\fs30}a wink and a nod from the head asshole in charge,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.25,0:01:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们拔出了枪 然后我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}they pulled their guns and it was right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.97,0:01:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟往常一样倒了霉\N{\fnArial\fs30}to our regularly scheduled shitstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.29,0:01:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把你关进来之前 你没看见泰尔西吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before they put you in here, you didn't see Tyreese?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.03,0:01:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.03,0:01:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辆画着白十字的黑车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black car with a white cross painted on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.70,0:01:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我努力跟着它 我尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to follow it. I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.41,0:01:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.65,0:01:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.31,0:01:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有四个混蛋往我们这边走来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, got four of them pricks coming our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.14,0:01:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.64,0:01:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,先攻眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go for their eyes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,再插喉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then their throats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,背靠在车厢两侧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your backs to the walls on either side of the car now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.03,0:03:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.24,0:04:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.62,0:05:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 你们射出了多少发子弹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. What were your shot counts?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,38发\N{\fnArial\fs30}38.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your shot count?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.12,0:05:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap, man, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.89,0:05:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我第一次围捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my first roundup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里完事后 回到岗哨点\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you're done here, go back to your point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.11,0:05:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,数一数弹壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}and count the shells.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.65,0:05:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯利明天才会捡弹壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kaylee won't be gathering them until tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.51,0:05:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, let me talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- A区四个 D区四个吗？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Four from A, four from D? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.63,0:05:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我跟你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, let me talk to you for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.60,0:05:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我跟你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me talk to you for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.94,0:05:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我跟你谈谈 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me talk to you for a minute. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 我们能解决这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this. We can fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.37,0:05:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没法解决 - 你不必这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, you can't. - You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.99,0:05:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说过了 有办法扭转一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We told you there's a way out of all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.67,0:05:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只用搏一搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just have to take a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有个伙伴知道如何阻止灾变\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a man who knows how to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.32,0:06:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有解决方法 我们得送他去华盛顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a cure. We just have to get him to Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.83,0:06:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要这样做 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.59,0:06:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以让世界回到原样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can put the world back to how it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.20,0:06:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,回不去了 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't go back, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以的 你不必这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can! You don't have to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看见你拿着包进了树林\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saw you go into the woods with a bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后空手出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and come out without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.02,0:06:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我调回了探子 所以还没去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to pull my spotters back before we could go look for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,包里有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把它藏起来了 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hid it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防不测？\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case things went bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.15,0:06:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我们会找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, we'll find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在出去太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's too dangerous to go out there right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.15,0:07:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.90,0:07:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个大包\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was a big bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真想让我这么做吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really gonna let me do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我带你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let me take you out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.28,0:07:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不可能 但这事有可能发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not gonna happen. This might.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.87,0:07:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's guns in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.62,0:07:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,AK47\N{\fnArial\fs30}AK-47.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.11,0:07:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,点44马格南\N{\fnArial\fs30}.44 Magnum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.17,0:07:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动武器 夜视镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Automatic weapons. Nightscope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一把复合弓\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a compound bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.93,0:07:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一把红柄砍刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a machete with a red handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.77,0:07:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会用那把刀杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm gonna use to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.48,0:07:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,两小时内把他们弄到烘干机上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have two hours to get them on the driers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去扮红脸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go back to public face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在可以大开杀戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now's the time we can get messy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.55,0:08:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但必须在日落之前收拾干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we need to dial it all in by sundown.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.32,0:08:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白 - 遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got it. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.20,0:08:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,查克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Chuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.14,0:09:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你们俩都送到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you both there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.49,0:09:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保你们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.60,0:09:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不会留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not gonna stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能 现在还不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.34,0:09:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须快点适应\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to have to be able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.55,0:10:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}More.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.75,0:11:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个枪声\N{\fnArial\fs30}That gunfire,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.50,0:11:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是从终点站传来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it could have been from Terminus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.71,0:11:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在攻击他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone was attacking them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者他们在攻击别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or they were attacking someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.41,0:11:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去弄清楚吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we even want to find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.24,0:11:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一条往东的铁道 会带我们去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another track due east. It'll get us there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.13,0:11:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be real careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.87,0:11:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要弄清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.11,0:12:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分钟倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}10-minute count.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.15,0:12:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞砸了就得靠自己了 马丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You screw up, you're on your own, Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用你说 我的屁股我自己擦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to tell me. I wipe my own ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.31,0:12:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历克斯真笨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex didn't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.62,0:12:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 我就知道刀女不是什么好鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I knew the chick with the sword was bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.56,0:12:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那婊子不拿武器都像个武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch looked like a weapon with a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.22,0:12:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是不让人省心\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was always a sloppy-ass mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我让艾伯特给那小孩放完血后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I told Albert I want the kid's hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.91,0:12:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的帽子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}after they bleed him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰开关 丢在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your finger off the button and drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在扮红脸前他们只宰八个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're only doing eight before public face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.49,0:12:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, y'all don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.81,0:12:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想要什么都成 我们那里欢迎所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you want, we got a place where everyone's welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.73,0:12:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up, man. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.40,0:12:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的刀女和戴帽子的小孩正是我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're friends of the chick with the sword and the kid in the hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们攻击了我们 我们只是把他们囚禁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They attacked us. We're just holding them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.32,0:12:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.90,0:12:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还囚禁了谁 你知道名字吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else do you have? Do you know their names?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.33,0:12:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只抓了男孩和武士 就他俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have the boy and the samurai, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.32,0:12:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不过是正当防卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just protecting ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.18,0:12:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.55,0:13:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们派了很多人出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a bunch of us out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.06,0:13:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,兵分六路\N{\fnArial\fs30}in six different directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.21,0:13:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才基地交火激烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a lot of gunfire back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须同时点燃烟花\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to set off our charges all at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,来引开行尸 这对你们也有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}to confuse the dead ones away. That's good for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.95,0:13:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.77,0:13:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群行尸正向终点站移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a herd heading toward Terminus right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.01,0:13:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不想引开他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want to confuse them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.10,0:13:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要他们的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need their help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里是个堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a compound.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.03,0:13:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会发现你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll see you coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.25,0:13:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是你们能突破走向那里的行尸群\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you even make it that far with all the cold bodies heading over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.48,0:13:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.84,0:13:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you gonna do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.95,0:13:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.15,0:14:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.87,0:14:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 她叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, she got a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.45,0:14:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是你女儿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She your daughter or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.55,0:14:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.07,0:14:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我认识一些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I know people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.28,0:14:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们不过是一起搭伙生存的混蛋罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just assholes I stay alive with.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.70,0:14:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女人也是你朋友吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other one your friend? The woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.84,0:14:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前也有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.97,0:14:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,周末约在一起看橄榄球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to watch football on Sundays.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.04,0:14:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起去教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went to church.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.90,0:14:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.95,0:15:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想不起来那情景了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't picture it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.02,0:15:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可笑 浑浑噩噩不知过了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's funny how you don't even notice the time go by.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.91,0:15:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天糟糕的事不断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horrible shit just stacks up day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后就习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.01,0:15:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没有习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't gotten used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.37,0:15:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是那种会救小宝宝的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the kind of guy who saves babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.40,0:15:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是困在海中\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of like saving an anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有船 却要死抱着船锚不放一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you're stuck without a boat in the middle of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.21,0:15:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇到什么心结了 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been behind some kind of walls, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.71,0:15:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still around,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.52,0:15:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你没干过脏活 我看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you haven't had to get your hands dirty. I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 你是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, you're a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完全不知道我干过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea about the things I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.75,0:15:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么你今天会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're gonna die today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.19,0:15:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么这个宝宝也会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why the baby is going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.68,0:16:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.10,0:16:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以坐上那辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can get in that car,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.30,0:16:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}get out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续幸存下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep on being lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你会杀了我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're gonna kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.89,0:16:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么还没杀了我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why haven't you killed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.47,0:16:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我活着对你有什么好处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How…How does having me alive help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.34,0:16:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么还要和我说话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell are you even talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.16,0:16:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.59,0:16:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,开上车子\N{\fnArial\fs30}take the car,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.30,0:16:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天不想做这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to do this today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.93,0:19:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是终点站吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Terminus?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.88,0:19:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定这次你会赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're gonna win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.62,0:19:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定你的朋友…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe your friend…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.54,0:19:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.42,0:19:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定那个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.89,0:19:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,被枪杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}just got capped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.75,0:19:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定等她回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'm gonna be the one who gets capped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.74,0:19:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会被枪杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.35,0:19:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天没有人会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's got to die today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.76,0:19:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 假如你真这么想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, if you believe that…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.89,0:19:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那死的人一定是你和那个小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}then it's definitely gonna be you and the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算那个地方已经化为灰烬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if that place is burning to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.57,0:19:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.88,0:19:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.37,0:19:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.87,0:19:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛瑞 这些人又逃不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gareth, these guys aren't going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我搞清情况之前 留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here until I know what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.23,0:20:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就干坐着吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we just sit here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.11,0:20:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.72,0:20:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.06,0:20:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在吗 葛瑞？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You there, Gareth?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.35,0:20:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他忙着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闻到烟味了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell the smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.80,0:20:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到枪声了吗 他说不定已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear the shots? He could be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.37,0:20:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们待在这里干嘛 这里可能会被炸飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell we doing here? The whole place could be going up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.77,0:21:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚执了一回勤就违反规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went on one roundup and you blew protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.95,0:21:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不用担心安保 那不是我们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't deal with security. That ain't our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.01,0:21:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is. Hey, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.08,0:21:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.94,0:21:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.21,0:21:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.02,0:21:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人袭击他们了 - 可能我们的人逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someone hit them. - Maybe our people got free.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.45,0:21:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.99,0:21:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我或许可以用这个弹壳把门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might be able to use this shell to compromise the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.29,0:21:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,听外面的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the sound of things,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.22,0:21:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能没人会给咱们开门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}there may not be anybody left to open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.24,0:21:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金 抱歉 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene, I'm sorry, but shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.20,0:21:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.61,0:21:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad's gonna be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.91,0:21:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们都会回来的 - 会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They all are. - They are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.18,0:21:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们回来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we need to get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.94,0:21:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要准备好 杀出一条血路\N{\fnArial\fs30}to fight our way out with them when they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.97,0:23:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们遇到麻烦 我们就有机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they got problems, we got a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.94,0:23:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是炸弹的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounded like a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.38,0:23:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是打仗的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a damn war.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.53,0:23:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.74,0:23:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们到底是什么人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.37,0:23:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They ain't people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.59,0:23:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,别杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.41,0:23:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他尸变吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.90,0:23:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇到他们的人 格杀勿论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cross any of these people, you kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.29,0:23:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别手软\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.86,0:23:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会手软的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.67,0:23:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跑的话 就可以摆脱它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we run, we can get by them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.88,0:24:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们无暇顾及\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.49,0:24:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把那些人救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to let those people out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.66,0:24:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人性还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's still who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.62,0:24:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.09,0:24:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.81,0:24:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.35,0:24:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.06,0:24:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're them!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.82,0:24:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.56,0:24:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.42,0:24:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.50,0:25:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们必须原路返回 - A区在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got to double back. - A is that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.27,0:25:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去的话就找不到路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go back, we don't know where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.96,0:25:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别无选择 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't really have a choice, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.56,0:26:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在这等着 - 瑞克 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait here. - Rick. Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.56,0:26:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,装弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reloading!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.61,0:27:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须原路返回\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to have to double back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.61,0:27:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器 转过身来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapons and turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.35,0:27:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看看你的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.73,0:27:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.53,0:28:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些标牌…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The signs…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.85,0:28:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were real.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.76,0:28:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里曾是个避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.52,0:28:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可有人来夺取了这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}People came and took this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.26,0:28:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只想知道… - 他们强奸 杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just tell me where… - And they raped and they killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.65,0:28:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还大笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they laughed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.76,0:28:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,持续了好几周\N{\fnArial\fs30}over weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.07,0:28:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们逃出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.10,0:28:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们战斗 夺回了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we fought and we got it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.52,0:28:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那时起 我们懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we heard the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.22,0:29:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不当屠夫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the butcher…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.30,0:29:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,便为羔羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you're the cattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.69,0:29:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,从车厢里带出来的人 他们在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The men they pulled from that train car, where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.76,0:29:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.39,0:29:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.23,0:29:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对准我的头吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}point it at my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.67,0:29:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本可以成为我们的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have been one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.61,0:29:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本可以听到上天的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have listened to what the world is telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.39,0:29:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们引诱人们来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lead people here and.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.46,0:29:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗劫他们 再杀掉他们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you take what they have and you kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.75,0:29:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方是做这种事的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what this place is?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.42,0:29:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 最初不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.42,0:29:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们不得不这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what it had to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.18,0:29:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.00,0:30:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.55,0:30:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.28,0:30:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.52,0:30:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! No, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.49,0:30:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.88,0:30:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.93,0:30:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.78,0:30:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把武器放在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your weapons on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.60,0:30:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在踢过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kick them over right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.16,0:30:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.11,0:30:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.88,0:31:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.73,0:31:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.02,0:31:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.18,0:31:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.26,0:31:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一扭她就死 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one twist, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.77,0:31:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 别逼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't! - Don't make me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.41,0:31:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.93,0:31:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.32,0:31:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛西娅 听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cynthia, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.32,0:31:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛西娅 听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cynthia, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.22,0:32:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就该这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.75,0:32:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.77,0:32:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.62,0:32:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.37,0:32:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.35,0:32:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.60,0:33:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决方法是什么 尤金？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the cure, Eugene?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.13,0:33:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.33,0:33:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.16,0:33:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别烦他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave him be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.49,0:33:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该继续准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to keep working.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.74,0:33:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但现在该听听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but it's time to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.74,0:33:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们不知道接下来会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause we don't know what's coming next.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.13,0:33:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来我们会从这里逃出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's next is we get out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.40,0:33:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我全盘托出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if I told you all,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.54,0:33:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我提供一步一步的指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if I provided step-by-step instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.74,0:33:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,配上插图和精心编排的常见问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}complete with illustrations and a well-composed FAQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.42,0:33:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我出了意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I went red-ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.38,0:33:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决方法也会随我而亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}the cure would still die with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.25,0:33:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你出事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.79,0:33:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的情况就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best-case scenario,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.02,0:33:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走出去面对子弹 大火和行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}we step out into a hellstorm of bullets, fire, and walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.27,0:33:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是飞毛腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not fleet of foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.23,0:33:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定不可能靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure as hell can't take a dead one down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.86,0:33:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,钝器和信心放倒行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}with sharp buttons and hella confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.66,0:33:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但是我们可以 而且我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but we can and we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.00,0:33:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不欠我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't owe us anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.72,0:33:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前还不欠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.02,0:34:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们只是想听听你的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we just want to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.06,0:34:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不说也没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.16,0:34:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是人类基因组计划十人小组的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was part of a 10-person team at the Human Genome Project.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.03,0:34:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将疾病改造为武器 对抗已武器化的疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}to weaponize diseases to fight weaponized diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.65,0:34:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,用致病微生物对抗致病微生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pathogenic microorganisms with pathogenic microorganisms.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.39,0:34:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,以毒攻毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.62,0:34:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不同部门间喝过酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interdepartmental drinks were had,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.14,0:34:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,建立起了关系 共享信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}relationships made, information shared.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.83,0:34:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对自动纠错传送系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am keenly aware of all the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.56,0:34:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,背后的运作细节了如指掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}behind fail-safe delivery systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.12,0:34:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,其目的是杀光这个星球上所有的活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to kill every living person on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.84,0:34:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为 只要对华盛顿的终端略作调整\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe with a little tweaking on the terminals in DC,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.11,0:34:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就可以扭转局势\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can flip the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.07,0:34:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉所有行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take out every last dead one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.89,0:34:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,以毒攻毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.78,0:35:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切顺利的话 听起来还是很炫酷的嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}All things being equal, it does sound pretty badass.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.60,0:35:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们继续准备吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.10,0:35:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 一路杀到栅栏边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Fight to the fence!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.88,0:35:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要离开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not leave his side!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.81,0:35:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快快快 - 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go, go, go! - Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.66,0:35:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跟上 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.73,0:36:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.28,0:36:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.95,0:36:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.39,0:36:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.77,0:36:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.18,0:36:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还待在这里做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell are we still around here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.13,0:36:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪支 还有补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns, and some supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.90,0:36:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,围着栅栏走 用步枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go along the fences. Use the rifles.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.09,0:36:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉剩下的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take out the rest of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.70,0:36:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.88,0:36:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没资格活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't get to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.24,0:36:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 我们逃出来了 结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, we got out. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.46,0:37:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们死光才算结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not over till they're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.56,0:37:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然结束了 那里着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell it isn't. That place is on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.59,0:37:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面全是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full of walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.75,0:37:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会为这种蠢事浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not dicking around with this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.64,0:37:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚才逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just made it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.15,0:37:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,栅栏倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fences are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.03,0:37:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要么逃 要么死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll run or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.31,0:38:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你做的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.94,0:38:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.10,0:38:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.11,0:39:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱迪思 你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judith. You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.73,0:39:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.35,0:39:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了一群行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were a bunch of walkers out here and.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.24,0:39:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他掐着朱迪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}he got his hands around Judith's neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.91,0:39:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.91,0:40:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.47,0:40:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.89,0:40:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.12,0:40:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道火是不是还在烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if the fire is still burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.14,0:40:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.87,0:40:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.49,0:40:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 但是去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but where?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.96,0:40:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,离那里越远越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere far away from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.30,0:40:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会跟他说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.06,0:40:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.37,0:41:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.63,0:41:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.79,0:41:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.83,0:41:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求你们了 不要再来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, please. Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.25,0:41:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.71,0:41:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.40,0:41:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay.
